<title>SPAIN: Cristaleria net Q3 profit 8.83 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Cristaleria net Q3 profit 8.83 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for third quarter 1996</p>
<p>(in billions of pesetas, unless stated):</p>
<p> Net taxed				8.825     vs     9.682</p>
<p> Group sales			  110.032     vs   108.947</p>
<p>NOTE - The parent group Cristaleria Espanola saw net profit of 5.549 billion pesetas, down from 5.752 billion during the same period last year. Sales were 39.656 billion compared with 40.095 billion last year.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
